<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Camo Skin</ansi> mutation

Your skin shifts and blurs, mimicking your surroundings with an
unsettling fluidity. You fade from notice — but something about the
effect repulses those who see through it.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  You enter rooms hidden from view by default
  Slightly improved dodge — your blurring outline is difficult to
  target cleanly

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Significantly reduced charisma — those who see through the effect
  are deeply unsettled

<ansi fg="yellow">Conflicts:</ansi> Bioluminescence, Pheromone Glands

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
